> Inspect the actual saved results

The figures below read actual saved outputs from this run. Native graph previews appear above the complete program. Reconstructed-task results retain the source budgets and are not reported as original benchmark scores.

> Actual validation history

Each panel reads the first recorded objective from a saved `history.tsv`. Different tasks and loss definitions have different units; compare curves within a panel. These are reconstructed-data outcomes with the original update budgets.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/linformer_history.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -lpthread -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
int main(){namespace fs=std::filesystem;std::vector<fs::path> files;for(const auto&entry:fs::recursive_directory_iterator("build/nn-completion/models/linformer"))if(entry.path().filename()=="history.tsv")files.push_back(entry.path());std::sort(files.begin(),files.end());if(files.empty())throw std::runtime_error("actual validation histories missing");auto layout=dm::graphics::RLayout::create((files.size()+1)/2,std::min(size_t(2),files.size()));for(const auto&file:files){std::ifstream in(file);std::string header,line;std::getline(in,header);std::vector<double>x,y;while(std::getline(in,line)){std::istringstream row(line);double step,value;if(row>>step>>value){x.push_back(step);y.push_back(value);}}if(x.empty())continue;auto plot=dm::graphics::RPlot::create();plot.lines(x,y,"saved validation objective",{37,99,235}).points(x,y,"saved rows",{37,99,235},4).x_label("Epoch or source step").y_label("Source objective; panels may use different units").title(file.parent_path().filename().string());layout.add(plot);}layout.size(1200,std::max(size_t(700),400*((files.size()+1)/2))).fit_panels().save_svg("build/linformer_history.svg");}
